---
const photo = "https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/010e15bf-cf68-4e42-a44e-daab21cd12f8.png";
---

<section class="py-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-stretch">

    <!-- Left: photo -->
    <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-auto min-h-0 order-1">
      <img
        src={photo}
        alt="Book Publishing"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Right: text -->
    <div class="bg-[rgba(217,217,217,0.1)] flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-8 md:px-10 py-10 sm:py-12 order-2">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase leading-snug text-black mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        HEARST Book Studio A Leading Book Publishing Company
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
        At HearEst Book Studio, we turn your manuscript into a published masterpiece
        with end-to-end support at every stage of the journey. From editorial
        development and cover design to distribution and marketing, our publishing
        team stands beside you from your first draft all the way to store shelves
        and digital storefronts worldwide.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed">
        We believe every author deserves a publishing partner who treats their
        book with the same passion and care they put into writing it. Our team
        combines industry expertise with a personalised approach, ensuring your
        book reaches the right readers through the right channels — in print,
        digital, and audio formats.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
  <p class="text-[#555] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
    Publishing a book is one of the most rewarding experiences an author can undertake — and with the right
    partner, it doesn't have to be overwhelming. HearEst Book Studio provides complete publishing solutions
    tailored to independent authors and small publishers alike. We handle cover design, interior formatting,
    ISBN registration, distribution setup, and launch strategy so you can focus on what you do best: writing.
    Our global distribution network ensures your book is available wherever readers are looking for their next
    favourite title.
  </p>
</div>
